(7505264, 1196584, 80058, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4 - Technical: 6 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 5 - Challenge: 5 - Overall Calculated Average Score: 5<br/> <br/>Amazing sky! Feels a tad over processed for my taste but it''s the composition that lets it down for me. I wish the little boat was on it''s own (for impact) and that you used a rule of thirds. To make the subject more aesthetically pleasing</td>', 'Composition: 4 - Technical: 6 - Creativity: 5 - Appeal: 5 - Challenge: 5 - Overall Calculated Average Score: 5 Amazing sky! Feels a tad over processed for my taste but it''s the composition that lets it down for me. I wish the little boat was on it''s own (for impact) and that you used a rule of thirds. To make the subject more aesthetically pleasing', '2017-03-15 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505265, 1196801, 80058, '<td valign="top">Composition: 9 - Technical: 4 - Creativity: 6 - Appeal: 6 - Challenge: 5 - Overall Calculated Average Score: 6<br/> <br/>The sky looks a bit fake, too much processing? Great composition and subject though</td>', 'Composition: 9 - Technical: 4 - Creativity: 6 - Appeal: 6 - Challenge: 5 - Overall Calculated Average Score: 6 The sky looks a bit fake, too much processing? Great composition and subject though', '2017-03-15 06:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
